        "Content": "Bright and spacious 2 bed apartment top floor apartment\r\nApprox 71 sq m / 764 sq ft\r\nDesignated car space in the secure underground car park\r\nExcellent transport links – walking distance to both DART and Dublin Bus stop\r\nBER rating C2"
